<p><b>AWS</b></p>

```yaml
---
pivnet-api-token: ((pivnet_token))
pivnet-file-glob: "ops-manager-aws*.yml"
pivnet-product-slug: ops-manager
product-version-regex: ^3\.1\.\d+(\+[A-Za-z0-9.-]+)?$
```
